{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-12-01 10:00:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN ANNOUNCES INAUGURAL THOROUGHBRED SUSTAINABILITY PARTNER AWARDS WINNERS', 'text': 'FIFTEEN\xa0CUSTOMERS AND SUPPLIERS HONORED FOR THEIR EFFORTS TO FURTHER\xa0 ENERGY EFFICIENCY, INNOVATION, AND ENVIRONMENTAL STEWARDSHIP\xa0 ATLANTA , DEC. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE RECIPIENTS OF ITS INAUGURAL THOROUGHBRED SUSTAINABILITY PARTNER AWARDS. THE AWARDS RECOGNIZE NORFOLK SOUTHERN PARTNER COMPANIES WHO ARE LEADERS IN THE CATEGORIES OF ENERGY EFFICIENCY, INNOVATION, AND ENVIRONMENTAL STEWARDSHIP.'}